  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 69456d03988ca4e88921b432c824af2b, type: 3}
  m_Name: GoodEnding
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue_SO
  _lines:
  - 'After leaving the apartment, I finally understood what had happened. Ten years
    ago, the landlord''s daughter took her own life in that room. Her spirit remained
    behind, attached to the mirror she used every day. Over time, she began searching
    for someone to replace her. '
  - 'The diary was written by a previous tenant who discovered the truth. The warnings
    scattered throughout the apartment were all attempts to stop the next victim
    from making the same mistakes. '
  - 'The mirror could occasionally tell the truth, which made it even more dangerous.
    By gaining trust little by little, it convinced people to ignore the real protection
    hidden inside the apartment. The incense on the altar and the doll were used
    to keep the spirit sealed. As long as they remained in place, she could not fully
    take over another person. '
  - 'In the end, I survived by following the clues left behind by those who came
    before me. '
  _playerReplyOptions: []
